    "text_delta": "king direct personal accusations.**\n  * *Less effective:* \"The panel was all men and biased against me.\"\n  * *More effective:* \"Given the organization's commitments to fair recruitment and gender diversity, I was surprised to find an all-male panel for a senior editorial post. Did this panel composition align with the broadcaster's recruitment guidelines, and what safeguards were in place to ensure objective scoring?\"\n\n---\n\n### Summary\nThe all-male panel is a valid red flag regarding procedural fairness and organizational culture. Rather than ignoring it or immediately filing an adversarial grievance, first **secure the written feedback**, **verify company panel policy**, and **consult a union or professional representative** to decide whether to request an internal review.\n",
